 {
  "node_id": "p185_19",
  "index": 19,
  "text": "Do you see the two problems? In the first case, foobar is misspelled; in the second, the name",
  "bbox": [
   134.5,
   315.63228999999995,
   513.5047900000001,
   325.63228999999995
  ],
